This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The AfriSenti corpus (Muhammad et al., 2023) is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and is
not redistributed here; src/download_data.py fetches it from the official
SemEval-2023 Task 12 repository. Its own licence and the authors' ethics
statement, which forbids commercial use, apply to any use of that data.

The hand-labelled Nigerian Pidgin finance and crypto posts in data/annotation/
were collected from public forum discussion for this project. They are offered
for non-commercial research use on the same terms, and carry no usernames.

Pretrained models carry their own licences: Davlan/afro-xlmr-base (MIT),
castorini/afriberta_base, xlm-roberta-base and roberta-base.
